# Line endings.
#
# Part of this repo was committed from Windows with CRLF in the blobs and part
# with LF, which made `gofmt -l` list nearly every Go file: gofmt reads the
# working copy, and a CRLF file is never gofmt-clean. Normalising to LF in the
# index *and* in the working copy settles it for every tool that reads files
# rather than blobs.
#
# Contributors on Windows keep working normally: editors and the Go toolchain
# all handle LF, and `core.autocrlf` no longer decides anything here.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be touched by the above.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
